===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computer hardware|dated}} A [[computer]] intended for use in the [[home]].
#: {{cot|en|personal computer}}
#* '''1983''', ''Using Your Home Computer'', Macmillan International Higher Education ({{ISBN|9781349068098}}), page 80:
#*: This last section is meant to draw your attention to a further sphere of potential use for your '''home computer''', namely letting it monitor and control some activity directly, without your own participation {{...}}

====Usage notes====
* Used mainly in the late 1970s and 1980s, when computers were available for the home for the first time.

